1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,288
Your pain doesn't vanish into thin air. It packs its bags and moves right into my bones.

2
00:00:06,588 --> 00:00:14,796
People pay me fortunes to take their broken bones, their burning fevers, and their relentless migraines away.

3
00:00:15,096 --> 00:00:21,864
I am the human sponge. Every ache finds a home inside my chest, screaming until I sleep.

4
00:00:22,164 --> 00:00:29,676
Tonight, a stranger hands me a glowing blue vial of agony so pure it makes my teeth ache.

5
00:00:29,976 --> 00:00:36,840
I press it against my palm. The fire spreads up my arm, devouring every nerve in my body.

6
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:44,364
As the white-hot flash fades, a voice whispers from the dark, calling a name I've never heard.

7
00:00:44,664 --> 00:00:52,152
The screen flashes my medical file. But the patient ID belongs to an infant born twenty years from now.

8
00:00:52,452 --> 00:00:59,892
Every agony I healed, every broken bone I took away, they weren't random gifts of mercy at all.

9
00:01:00,192 --> 00:01:06,984
I wasn't saving strangers from their suffering. I was building a lifetime of torture for my own child.

10
00:01:07,284 --> 00:01:11,172
How many times can you break the same heart before it stops beating?
